+1. `src/click/types.py` - Enhanced Choice class
+2. `src/click/core.py` - Updated Option help display
+
+## Files Added
+
+1. `tests/test_typed_choice.py` - Feature tests
+2. `tests/test_problem_requirements.py` - Requirement verification tests
+3. `demo_typed_choice.py` - Demonstration script
+4. `example_comprehensive.py` - Comprehensive feature showcase
